WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.881
The king paced up and down the Throne Room.

2
00:00:10.882 --> 00:00:14.745
"I wish my mother would leave," he said.

3
00:00:14.746 --> 00:00:17.903
"She's making everyone unhappy."

4
00:00:17.904 --> 00:00:20.193
"Wizard!" Dirk snapped.

5
00:00:20.194 --> 00:00:22.575
"Did you find a magic spell?"

6
00:00:22.576 --> 00:00:25.463
Tom shook his head. "No, but—"

7
00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:29.140
"Fix this mess, Wizard!" Dirk said.

8
00:00:29.141 --> 00:00:33.325
Tom gulped and took out his wand.

9
00:00:33.326 --> 00:00:41.695
Just then Cat ran into the room.

10
00:00:41.696 --> 00:00:46.314
"Tom!" she said. "Try this instead!"

11
00:00:46.315 --> 00:00:48.597
Tom blinked.

12
00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:51.041
Cat had the wishing cap!

13
00:00:51.042 --> 00:00:53.860
"How did you get that?" Tom asked.

14
00:00:53.861 --> 00:00:56.508
"I took it," Cat said.

15
00:00:56.509 --> 00:01:01.567
"But hurry! The royal grandmother is chasing me!"

16
00:01:01.568 --> 00:01:06.570
Tom put on the wishing cap.

17
00:01:06.571 --> 00:01:11.111
"I wish to undo all of the royal grandmother's wishes!"

18
00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:14.226
Poof!

19
00:01:14.227 --> 00:01:19.239
The king sat on his throne.

20
00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:24.508
Food appeared in the kitchen.

21
00:01:24.509 --> 00:01:30.813
The tiger was gone.

22
00:01:30.814 --> 00:01:35.170
"Tom!" The royal grandmother burst into the Throne Room.

23
00:01:35.171 --> 00:01:37.819
Tom quickly made one more wish.

24
00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:43.932
"I wish this wasn't a wishing cap!"

25
00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:48.037
"That's my cap!" cried the royal grandmother.

26
00:01:48.038 --> 00:01:49.908
She snatched the cap.

27
00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:55.365
"I wish to send Tom to the Grim Dungeon!" she said.

28
00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:57.504
Nothing happened.

29
00:01:57.505 --> 00:02:00.966
The royal grandmother stomped her foot.

30
00:02:00.967 --> 00:02:07.553
"I am very unhappy! I'm leaving at once!"

31
00:02:07.554 --> 00:02:14.369
She marched away.

32
00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:23.437
"Hooray!" the king shouted. "I got my wish!"

33
00:02:23.438 --> 00:02:28.250
"Hmpf!" Dirk snorted.

34
00:02:28.251 --> 00:02:30.959
Tom smiled.

35
00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:37.544
And Cat purred.

